  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperation and Technical Support Services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to enable IOM technical and administrative support to contribute to the design and implementation of policies, plans and programmes under the Plan &#x201C;Argentina Innovadora&#x201D; 2020 and 2030 (in preparation). The plan is intended to contribute to increasing the competitiveness of the productive sector, based on goods and services with higher technological density and coordinate the organization of the Scientific Technological System and promote research, financing and transfer of scientific and technological knowledge.  All this would be done through instruments that directly and indirectly contribute to the retention of potential Argentine migrant scientists and technologists, the return of those residents abroad, and the expansion of links between local and foreign scientists and technologists to strengthen the National Innovation System.</narrative>
  </description>
